# Vercel / Production Environment Variables
# Hinterlege diese API-Keys in den Vercel Project Settings (Settings -> Environment Variables)
#
# 1. Google Gemini (Serverless Proxy - SICHER ALS VERCEL SECRET):
#    Variable: GEMINI_API_KEY (ohne VITE_-Prefix, Type: Secret)
#    Die App ruft /api/gemini auf, sodass der Schlüssel niemals im Browser-Bundle landet.
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# 2. Optionale Drittanbieter-Schlüssel (falls gewünscht):
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_firebase_api_key_here
VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
VITE_MISTRAL_API_KEY=your_mistral_api_key_here
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key_here
